---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/uliboooo.css";
const sns_list = [
  {
    id: "github",
    link: "https://github.com/Uliboooo",
    logo: "/icons/github/GitHub_Invertocat_Black.svg",
  },
  {
    id: "x",
    link: "https://x.com/Uliboooo",
    logo: "/icons/x/logo_black.svg",
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout title="Uliboooo" activeTab="uliboooo">
  <div class="about_me">
    <div class="main_content">
      <img src="/uliboooo.webp" alt="Uliboooo profile image" class="profile-image" />
      <h2>Uliboooo</h2>
      <p>ソフトウェアと文字が好きな大学生。oは4つです。RustでCLIツールなどを開発しています。Vim派。</p>
      <p>I am a university student who loves Software and Text. My name has four ‘o’. I develop CLI tools mainly using Rust. <span class="no-wrap">I’m a Vimmer.</span></p>
      <nav>
          {
          sns_list.map(p => (
            <a href={p.link} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span class="icon" style={`--icon-url: url(${p.logo})`}></span>
            </a>
          ))
          }

      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
